<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>폴리오 - 친구</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/manage.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/calendar.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="appShell">
    {{! 컨트롤러에서 pageTitle="친구", navFriend=true 를 내려주세요 }}
    {{> layout/sidebar}}
    <main class="mainArea">
        <div class="topBar"></div>
        <section class="notebook">
            {{! 컨트롤러에서 bookmarks = BookmarkLayout.of(1) 을 내려주세요 (친구 = 왼쪽 1개, 오른쪽 3개) }}
            {{> layout/bookLayout}}

            <section class="leftPage">
                <div class="placeholder-page">
                    <h2>친구</h2>
                    <p>친구 화면이 들어갈 자리입니다.</p>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="rightPage">
                <div class="placeholder-page">
                    <p>준비 중이에요</p>
                </div>
            </section>
        </section>
    </main>
</div>
</body>
</html>
